# Ownership of the parts of this repository where a mistake is expensive or
# hard to reverse: the publishing pipeline, and the licensing record.
#
# Currently advisory. `main` requires the Validate check but not an approving
# review, because a required approval would deadlock a solo maintainer. This
# file requests review rather than enforcing it, and becomes meaningful the
# moment a second contributor appears or reviews are required.

# Packaging and CI. The packer is the single producer of content.zip's bytes,
# and its exclusion list is mirrored in clonk-org/clonk-rs.
/.github/                       @syb0rg

# Licensing. THIRD_PARTY_GAME_CONTENT.md records permissions obtained for packs
# that are not covered by the CC BY-NC grant.
/THIRD_PARTY_GAME_CONTENT.md    @syb0rg
/clonk_content_license.txt      @syb0rg

# Version identity, which the engine reads and the update channel keys on.
/Version.txt                    @syb0rg
/set_version.sh                 @syb0rg
